# Grafana alerting

## Defaults

1. List existing rules before adding duplicates.
2. Prefer symptom-based, actionable alerts; avoid noisy flapping.
3. Changes to routing / contact points need an explicit ask.
4. Never invent rule UIDs — resolve via list/get.
